<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658240;left:-52px;\r\ntop:488px;width:994px;height:490px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h1 align=center style='text-align:center'><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ULTRASONOGRAPHY OF UPPER ABDOMEN<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>LIVER: SPAN:- <\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Liver\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0cm ; AP diameter:- \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0cm.\r\n(approx). Hepatic margins smooth. shape preserved. Parenchymal echopattern is\r\nnormal. There is no sizeable focal parenchymal abnormality. Intrahepatic\r\nvascular and biliary radicles are not dilated. Left lobe and caudate lobe\r\nappears normal in size.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>GALL BLADDER<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Well distended - elliptical. The walls are regular\r\nand normal in thickness.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Lumen is clear. No sizeable calculus is seen in the\r\nlumen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PORTA: CBD<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:- <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CBD normal in calibre measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0cm. and\r\nshows clear lumen. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No obvious calculus or SOL noted within. No filling\r\ndefect seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PORTAL VEIN<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Portal vein\u00a0 measures approx: \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0cm. (normal).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PANCREAS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Pancreas normal in shape \u00a0&amp; size. Outline is\r\nregular. Echopattern is normal. No SOL is seen. Pancreatic duct is not dilated.\r\nNo abnormality is seen in peripancreatic region.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0<b><u>SPLEEN<\/u>:- <\/b><\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0Normal in size, outline and echotexture. No focal\r\nabnormality is seen<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0in the parenchyma. The splenic vein and its\r\ntributaries appear normal.\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0Splenic Span measures :\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0cm. (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both kidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0cm.\r\n(approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left Kidney measures :\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0cm.\r\n(approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URETERS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Not dilated hence not visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>MISCELLANEOUS:<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> No free fluid\r\nis seen in peritoneal cavity \/ either pleural space. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No\r\nretroperitoneal abnormality is seen. Aorta and IVC appears normal. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No\r\nenlarged para-aortic lymphnodes seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION: <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No significant abnormality is seen in USG scanning\r\nof upper abdomen.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"127.6pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}